    <string name="menu_benchmark">Benchmark</string>
    <string name="bench_intro">Runs the same PP 512 / TG 128 test three ways on the loaded model: naïve (8 threads across all cores), threads-only (the same thread count ENTITY picks, but with core pinning switched off), and ENTITY Auto (the shipped configuration, generation pinned to the performance cores). The middle run is what separates the gain that comes from the thread count from the gain that comes from pinning. Power draw is measured too, so you see speed and energy efficiency side by side. Unplug the phone: power and tokens-per-watt are hidden while charging.</string>
